paper-lens-preferences-tagline = Read papers with Codex models
paper-lens-preferences-intro = Connect your ChatGPT account to use eligible models and your plan's usage. Paper Lens runs independently inside Zotero.
paper-lens-preferences-auth-title = ChatGPT connection
paper-lens-preferences-account-label = Account
paper-lens-preferences-account-select =
    .aria-label = Choose a saved ChatGPT account or connect another
paper-lens-preferences-account-new = Add another ChatGPT account…
paper-lens-preferences-account-connect = Connect ChatGPT account…
paper-lens-preferences-account-current = { $account } (current)
paper-lens-preferences-sign-in = Continue with ChatGPT
paper-lens-preferences-sign-out = Sign out
paper-lens-preferences-auth-cancel = Cancel sign-in
paper-lens-preferences-usage = Manage usage
paper-lens-preferences-auth-disconnected = Connect ChatGPT here before translating.
paper-lens-preferences-auth-connected = Connected: { $account }. ChatGPT plan usage is enabled.
paper-lens-preferences-auth-plan-disabled = Signed in: { $account }. Authorize ChatGPT plan usage to translate.
paper-lens-preferences-auth-connecting = Complete sign-in and authorize Paper Lens in your browser. Return here afterward.
paper-lens-preferences-auth-working = Updating the connection…
paper-lens-preferences-auth-new = Complete authorization to switch to another account. Your current connection remains active until then.
paper-lens-preferences-auth-revoke-unconfirmed = Signed out locally. Remote revocation could not be confirmed; disconnect Paper Lens in ChatGPT Settings if needed.
paper-lens-preferences-auth-help = Paper Lens stores its own credentials securely in this Zotero profile. Each account is authorized separately. Translation uses your ChatGPT plan's shared limits; you can manage app limits in ChatGPT Settings. Codex does not need to be running.
paper-lens-preferences-model-label = Translation model
paper-lens-preferences-model-select =
    .aria-label = Choose translation model
paper-lens-preferences-model-refresh = Refresh
    .title = Query the connected account's available models
paper-lens-preferences-model-help = The default is gpt-6-luna. Each option shows the actual model identifier. Your choice is saved only in Paper Lens. Model access depends on your account and workspace.
paper-lens-preferences-model-loading = Checking the connected account's model list…
paper-lens-preferences-model-login = Connect ChatGPT and authorize plan usage to load available models.
paper-lens-preferences-model-loaded = Account model list loaded.
paper-lens-preferences-model-unavailable = The selected model is not listed for this account. Choose another model or check account access.
paper-lens-preferences-model-fallback = Could not load the account's model list. gpt-6-luna and your selected model are preserved. Try refreshing later.
paper-lens-preferences-auto-translate =
    .label = Translate automatically when text is selected
paper-lens-preferences-auto-translate-help = When enabled, selected text is translated automatically. Local translations appear immediately; other selections are sent to the connected ChatGPT model.
paper-lens-preferences-cache-title = Local translation cache
paper-lens-preferences-cache-help = Complete translations are saved locally, up to 1,000 entries / 10 MB. The least recently used entries are removed when full. The cache does not sync with your Zotero library. Clearing it does not delete notes.
paper-lens-preferences-cache-clear = Clear translation cache
paper-lens-preferences-cache-clearing = Clearing translation cache…
paper-lens-preferences-cache-cleared = Translation cache cleared.
paper-lens-preferences-cache-clear-failed = Could not clear the translation cache. Please retry later.
